SUMMARY:Winter Solstice Yoga
DESCRIPTION:High Park Yoga\nAs we welcome the Winter Solstice\, we invite 
 you to join us for a special evening of gentle yoga\, breathwork\, stillne
 ss and connection.\n[Get your ticket now](https://luma.com/fyti6kj4) ($25 
 pp\, indoor event)\n\n*Gentle yoga & mindful movement\n- Grounding breathw
 ork\n*Meditation & reflection\n- A closing fire ceremony beneath the winte
 r sky\n\nEveryone will receive a small Solstice gift to take home\, carryi
 ng a little of the light with them.\nJoin Tanya [from Rooted by Tanya](htt
 ps://rootedbytanya.ca/)\, and co-host Nici from [Breathing in Nature](http
 s://www.breathinginnature.com/)\, for this special gathering.\nSpace is li
 mited to only 13 participants. [Get your ticket now](https://luma.com/fyti
 6kj4)!
